# Product UI (UX Flow)

- Components: named imports from `ant-design-vue`, PascalCase tags (`Button`, not `a-button`)
- Types: `ButtonProps`, `MenuProps`, `ThemeConfig`, `FormInstance`, `Rule` from the package
- Layout: antdv `Space` / `Row` / `Col` first; Tailwind utilities for extras
- **No** SFC `<style>`; **no** shadcn / Radix
- User-facing copy: Persian; `ConfigProvider` RTL / `fa_IR`
- Tailwind RTL: `ms-*` `me-*` `ps-*` `pe-*` `start-*` `end-*` `text-start` — not `ml-*`/`mr-*` for layout
- Fonts: Vazirmatn via existing CSS entry — do not add Inter/Roboto stacks
- Icons: `@ant-design/icons-vue` only
